{{also|búr|bür|bur-}}
==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|burr}}

===Etymology===
From a Scandinavian language, such as Danish {{m|da|burre||bur, burdock}}. See also [[burr]].

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A rough, prickly [[husk]] around the seeds or fruit of some plants.
# Any of several [[plant]]s having such husks.
# A rotary cutting implement having a selection of variously shaped heads.
# {{alternative form of|burr|nodot=yes|lang=en}} (small piece of material)

====Translations====
{{trans-see|prickly husk|burr}}

===Anagrams===
* {{l|en|RUB}}, {{l|en|rub}}

